The best performing models also connect the encoder and decoder through an attention mechanism.,0,Vaswani et al. (2017),background,arXiv:1706.03762,Literature context describing prior attention architectures.
Recurrent models typically factor computation along the symbol positions of the input and output sequences.,0,Vaswani et al. (2017),background,arXiv:1706.03762,Domain background on standard sequential recurrent factorization.
